1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,480
Now, I know the commitment to misunderstanding me is one that many of you all have taken a vow of.

2
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:10,800
Nonetheless, I come here to further explain my messaging.

3
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:24,220
When I say that this is Black people's fight, I say that understanding that there is a multi-pronged approach to resistance.

4
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,400
It's like, look at the Smart, Funny, and Black logo.

5
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:37,060
Rebel Fam, Woke Fam, Culture Fam, Fly Fam, the fighters, the thinkers, the artists, the innovators.

6
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:41,680
I do not believe Black people should be on the front lines right now.

7
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:43,560
By no means.

8
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,460
Listen to this priest right here.

9
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:51,920
I have told the clergy of the Episcopal Diocese of New Hampshire, make sure they have their wills written.

10
00:00:51,920 --> 00:01:09,860
Because it may be that now is no longer the time for statements, but for us with our bodies to stand between the powers of this world and the most vulnerable.

11
00:01:09,860 --> 00:01:15,100
When I hear Black people say, this is none of my business, this isn't my fight, you ain't never fought for nothing before.

12
00:01:15,180 --> 00:01:21,560
Because you would know if you have fought that there are so many places to be in the fight beyond the front line.

13
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:28,080
There are so many necessary roles in support beyond being on the front line.

14
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:38,320
And when I said your Blackness is flimsy, what I'm referring to is the fact that you don't realize the depth of your own Blackness and its ability to show up beyond simply being a body.

15
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:42,500
Because you are still looking at yourself the same way a colonizer looks at you.

16
00:01:42,660 --> 00:01:44,840
As simply a body with Black skin.

17
00:01:45,140 --> 00:01:46,540
No, baby, you are more than that.

18
00:01:46,540 --> 00:01:53,760
And when you are grounded in this, you understand that you have an uncanny ability to innovate.

19
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:59,240
You understand that you have an uncanny connection to spiritual power.

20
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:03,180
You understand you have an uncanny connection to seasoning your food.

21
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:05,260
And what does the movement need?

22
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:06,840
The movement needs spirituality.

23
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:09,840
The movement needs artistry and innovation.

24
00:02:10,180 --> 00:02:12,840
And the movement needs sustenance.

25
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:18,580
There will absolutely be no effort of protection happening in your silo.

26
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:19,640
None.

27
00:02:20,300 --> 00:02:22,760
White people, you're on the front line.

28
00:02:23,020 --> 00:02:25,180
Everybody else, we got other work to do.

29
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:27,720
That's a very easy message that anyone can get behind.

30
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:29,980
And if you still mad, it's because you want to be.

31
00:02:30,580 --> 00:02:31,560
Smart, funny, it!

32
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,020
Smart!

